      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.04,
      405.6,
      297.61,
      463.67
    ],
    "text": "I hereby give notice, under Sub-section (1) of Section 7 ofthe Land Acquisition Act, as amended by the LandAcquisition (Amendment) Act, No. 28 of 1964, that theGovernment intends to acquire the following Land/servitude which is required for a Public purpose:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      77.76,
      477.6,
      290.68,
      487.67
    ],
    "text": "Description of the Land or Servitude to be acquired:",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-ItalicMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.04,
      496.8,
      297.68,
      566.87
    ],
    "text": "The following allotment of land is situated at villages ofWaliwa in Divisional Secretary's Division Pitabaddara inthe District of Mathara Southern Province and marked inSurveyor General Plan No F.V.P. 10, Sheet No. 102 andSupplement No. 88 Servey Requisition No. MR/PTB/2018/164 and Date 15/03/2018. Containg in Extent 2.0234 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.04,
      580.85,
      297.28,
      639.35
    ],
    "text": "Lot No. - 1671Name of the Land: Morawaka Waththa (Radagewaththaand Katuanagewaththa); North: Lot Nos. 81 and 76; East:Lot Nos. 76 and 81; South and West: Lot No. 81; Extent:2.0234 Hectares.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPS-BoldMT",
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      71.04,
      653.28,
      297.51,
      675.59
    ],
    "text": "All persons interested in the aforesaid land/lands* onwhich servitude is to be acquired are hereby required to",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 0,
    "bbox": [
      321.84,
      322.32,
      562.9,
      417.11
    ],
    "text": "appear personally, or by agents duly authorized in writing,before me at the Divisional Secretariat - Pitabeddara on the20th February 2019 of at 10.00 a.m., and are hereby requestedto notify to me in writing (in duplicate) on or before the 13thFebruary 2019 the nature of their interests in the Land, theparticulars of their claims for compensation for the acquisitionof the said land/servitude*, the amount of compensation andthe details of the Computation of such amount.",
    "fonts": [
      "TimesNewRomanPSMT"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.070419311523438
    ]
